tate - it is)Tj-371 -12 TD 1.911 Tw (impossible to send the Jews \(from Palestine\) elsewhere and it is clear that if they )Tj385 0 TD 2.671 Tw (send the)Tj-385 -12 TD 1.657 Tw (Arabs \(to one of the Arab States in the area\), there will be an improvement )Tj356 0 TD 4.388 Tw (in their living)Tj-356 -12 TD 0.279 Tc 0 Tw (standards.")Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 1.144 Tw (Ben-Gurion suggested that possibly the Labour Party Congress would delete the )Tj371 0 TD 0 Tw (clause)Tj-397 -12 TD 2.719 Tw (on transfer and if so the Zionists would be satisfied with the first part )Tj347 0 TD 4.4 Tw (of the proposal.)Tj-347 -12 TD 1.701 Tw (However, )Tj48 0 TD 1.922 Tw (Ben-Gurion concluded, "It seems to me that we need not be sorry that the word)Tj-48 -12 TD 1.098 Tw ('transfer' was used by non-Jews." \()Tj/F4 7 Tf157 3 TD (1)Tj/F4 10 Tf4 -3 TD 0.575 Tw (\) [In )Tj22 0 TD 4.19 Tw (a similar vein, the historian Anita Shapira wrote)Tj-183 -12 TD 3.887 Tw (that "it )Tj40 0 TD 2.814 Tw (is possible to assume with a high degree of probability that if one of the Great)Tj-40 -12 TD 1.065 Tw (Powers had volunteered )Tj114 0 TD 2.577 Tw (to carry out a transfer of the Arabs of Palestine, very few of the)Tj-114 -12 TD 0.059 Tc 0 Tw (Zionist leaders would have opposed such a move." \()Tj/F4 7 Tf234 3 TD (2)Tj/F4 10 Tf4 -3 TD 0 Tc (\)])Tj-212 -12 TD 1.866 Tw (David Senator, who had been a member of "Brit Shalom" )Tj272 0 TD 3.18 Tw (disagreed with Ben-Gurion)Tj-298 -12 TD 0.062 Tc 0 Tw (who saw this transfer proposal as a proposal made by non-Jews. "It )Tj304 0 TD 0 Tc 3.287 Tw (is correct that the British)Tj-304 -12 TD -0.065 Tc 0 Tw (Labour Party proposed )Tj104 0 TD 0 Tc 0.799 Tw (it," went on Senator, "but there is not one Arab nor even one non-Arab)Tj-104 -12 TD 0.125 Tc 0 Tw (who will believe that we did not know about this )Tj226 0 TD 0 Tc 1.776 Tw (or that we were not involved in this... The)Tj-226 -12 TD 2.589 Tw (psychological effect will not be as Mr. Ben-