ced to transfer these Arabs,)Tj-58 -12 TD 0.096 Tc 0 Tw (otherwise there will not be room for Jews to settle.")Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 1.682 Tw (Magnes, however, seems to )Tj131 0 TD 3.235 Tw (have misunderstood them. The Peel Commission's main)Tj-157 -12 TD 0 Tw (concern had )Tj57 0 TD 2.896 Tw (been not with the difficulty of accommodating Jewish immigrants within the)Tj-57 -12 TD 1.705 Tw (proposed boundaries of the Jewish State, but with the fear that a mixed population of )Tj405 0 TD 0 Tw (Jews)Tj-405 -12 TD 1.351 Tw (and Arabs would be )Tj98 0 TD 3.8 Tw (a constant source of friction. It was for this latter reason that the)Tj-98 -12 TD -0.049 Tc 0 Tw (Commission recommended compulsory transfer from the areas of mixed population.)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 1.081 Tw (Magnes commented, "You say that you want to transfer the Arabs )Tj306 0 TD 2.567 Tw (to Transjordan with)Tj-332 -12 TD 2.082 Tw (their agreement, even though the Royal Commission has stated that if )Tj334 0 TD 2.426 Tw (the Arabs refuse to)Tj-334 -12 TD 3.392 Tw (leave the Jewish State voluntarily, it will be necessary to )Tj284 0 TD 3.226 Tw (use compulsion." He told the)Tj-284 -12 TD 0.115 Tc 0 Tw (meeting that it was unrealistic to assume that the Arabs would be willing to )Tj346 0 TD 0 Tc 3.78 Tw (leave the Jewish)Tj-346 -12 TD 1.78 Tw (State. Even in )Tj68 0 TD 2.326 Tw (the event of some Arabs agreeing to transfer, their fellow Arabs would not)Tj-68 -12 TD 0.122 Tc 0 Tw (permit them to enter the Arab State, since the Arab leaders would )Tj301 0 TD 0 Tc 1.544 Tw (prefer them to remain as a)Tj-301 -12 TD 0.12 Tc 0 Tw (hostile element in the Jewish State. Magnes' speech was followed by stormy )Tj346 0 TD 0 Tc 1.675 Tw (protests from the)Tj-346 -12 TD 0 Tw (plenum! \()Tj/F4 7 Tf43 3 TD (3)Tj/F4 10 Tf4 -3 TD (\))Tj-21 -12 TD 0.069 Tc (According to the Peel Commission's partition plan, the Negev was to )Tj312 0 TD 0 Tc 2.553 Tw (be allocated, in its)Tj-338 -12 TD 3.186 Tw (entirety, t