w (financial compensation. The Arabs agreed to this proposal and Levy then went to Syria )Tj396 0 TD 0.262 Tc (where)Tj-396 -12 TD 0.068 Tc (he found suitable land and the transfer of Arabs was thus implemented. \()Tj/F4 7 Tf329 3 TD (2)Tj/F4 10 Tf4 -3 TD (\))Tj-307 -12 TD 0 Tc 2.313 Tw (Baron Rothschild was )Tj106 0 TD 3.442 Tw (not however satisfied with the proximity to Palestine of the)Tj-132 -12 TD 0.032 Tc 0 Tw (transferred Arabs. This we know from a meeting which took place between )Tj338 0 TD 0 Tc 1.031 Tw (him and Levy on a)Tj-338 -12 TD 0.249 Tc 0 Tw (visit of )Tj35 0 TD 0 Tc 1.569 Tw (the latter to Paris. The Baron began by praising Levy for his work in redeeming the)Tj-35 -12 TD 2.584 Tw (land and advised him to continue with similar work. Levy then )Tj311 0 TD 5.647 Tw (.reported Rothschild as)Tj-311 -12 TD 0.087 Tc 0 Tw (saying, "but it is better not to transfer the Arabs to )Tj228 0 TD 0 Tc 1.792 Tw (Syria and Transjordan since they are parts)Tj-228 -12 TD 0.109 Tc 0 Tw (of Palestine, but to Mesopotamia \(Iraq\). He added that under )Tj279 0 TD 0 Tc (such circumstances, he would be)Tj-279 -12 TD 2.049 Tw (prepared to send the Arabs, on his account, new agricultural machinery and instructors )Tj416 0 TD 0 Tw (of)Tj-416 -12 TD 0.208 Tc (agriculture." \()Tj/F4 7 Tf64 3 TD (3)Tj/F4 10 Tf4 -3 TD (\))Tj-42 -12 TD 0 Tc (Similar comments by )Tj96 0 TD 1.858 Tw (Rothschild on transfer were reported by Levy in a talk which he)Tj-122 -12 TD 1.396 Tw (gave on the English language radio )Tj167 0 TD 2.948 Tw (channel "Kol Zion Lagolah" in July 1951. Levy's main)Tj-167 -12 TD 0.022 Tc 0 Tw (work was the acquisition of land in Palestine, and on one occasion had )Tj316 0 TD 0 Tc (to conclude an exchange)Tj-316 -12 TD 2.488 Tw (of properties in a certain )Tj123 0 TD 4.404 Tw (Lower Galilee village. It was on the Sabbath that Levy and)Tj-123 -12 TD 3.099 Tw (Rothschild met in Haifa to discuss the matter. )Tj229 0 TD 3.542 Tw (The Baron