ed by the stamp)Tj-315 -12 TD 0.13 Tc 0 Tw (of the "Weizmann Archives"\), and so cannot add anything to this point.])Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 1.404 Tw (Who wrote in this handwritten amendment? According to the )Tj289 0 TD 3.833 Tw (Staff of the Weizmann)Tj-315 -12 TD 2.058 Tw (Archives it was )Tj77 0 TD 2.725 Tw (definitely not written by Weizmann or Ben-Gurion, though it might well)Tj-77 -12 TD 2.652 Tw (have been written by Weizmann's secretary )Tj211 0 TD 2.701 Tw (in London, Miss Doris May. \()Tj/F4 7 Tf143 3 TD (4)Tj/F4 10 Tf4 -3 TD 3.782 Tw (\) In fact it is)Tj-358 -12 TD 0 Tw (difficult to see why such an amendment )Tj180 0 TD 1.428 Tw (was made. As we have seen earlier, both Ben-Gurion)Tj-180 -12 TD 0 Tw (and Weizmann had in previous )Tj143 0 TD 1.68 Tw (years suggested to the High Commissioners of the time, that)Tj-143 -12 TD 0.117 Tc 0 Tw (Arabs from Palestine be resettled in Transjordan. The Colonial Secretary had almost )Tj383 0 TD 0.373 Tc (certainly)Tj-383 -12 TD 0 Tc 1.911 Tw (been informed of these ideas, and thus there was no reason for not )Tj321 0 TD 4.478 Tw (giving him the reply)Tj-321 -12 TD 0.251 Tc 0 Tw (originally typed )Tj78 0 TD 0 Tc 1.684 Tw (in the minutes of this meeting. Maybe it was an amateurish attempt to try)Tj-78 -12 TD 2.231 Tw (and hide the fact from future historians that the Zionist leaders had )Tj327 0 TD 2.453 Tw (in the past proposed)Tj-327 -12 TD 0.32 Tc 0 Tw (transfer!)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 2.977 Tw (An interesting twist occurred in mid-1941, when Weizmann had a discussion )Tj376 0 TD 0.667 Tc 0 Tw (with)Tj-402 -12 TD 0.143 Tc (thirty-one leading American Zionist and non--Zionist personalities, )Tj310 0 TD 0 Tc 1.201 Tw (in New York. During the)Tj-310 -12 TD 0 Tw (course of this discussion, Weizmann referred to )Tj212 0 TD 1.65 Tw (the Peel Commission's transfer proposal. "You)Tj-212 -12 TD 1.352 Tw (remember," he said, "one of the decisions of )Tj206 0 TD 3.018 Tw (the Royal Commission carried dynamite