and Herzl had plans for each )Tj135 0 TD 0 Tc 1.879 Tw (of these classes of population. With regard to the landowners,)Tj-135 -12 TD 1.677 Tw (Herzl wrote in his diary: "When we occupy the land, we shall bring )Tj322 0 TD 3.59 Tw (immediate benefits to)Tj-322 -12 TD 2.135 Tw (the state that receives us. We must expropriate gently, the private property )Tj359 0 TD 3.134 Tw (on the estates)Tj-359 -12 TD 1.101 Tw (assigned to us." \()Tj/F4 7 Tf78 3 TD (1)Tj/F4 10 Tf4 -3 TD 1.45 Tw (\) For the remainder of the population, he wrote in )Tj237 0 TD 2.873 Tw (his diary on the same)Tj-319 -12 TD 4.665 Tw (day: "We )Tj52 0 TD 4.487 Tw (shall try to spirit the penniless population across the border by procuring)Tj-52 -12 TD 2.341 Tw (employment for it in the transit countries )Tj201 0 TD 2.835 Tw (whilst denying it any employment in our own)Tj-201 -12 TD 0 Tw (country." \()Tj/F4 7 Tf47 3 TD (2)Tj/F4 10 Tf4 -3 TD (\) )Tj6 0 TD 1.318 Tw (We can thus see that the means Herzl envisaged to transfer non-Jews out of the)Tj-57 -12 TD 2.071 Tw (Jewish )Tj34 0 TD 2.85 Tw (State, was to deny them sources of livelihood in the Jewish State, and find them)Tj-34 -12 TD 0.111 Tc 0 Tw (employment elsewhere.)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 1.336 Tw (In the above )Tj61 0 TD 3.049 Tw (extract, it is noticable that Herzl did not use the words "Palestine" or)Tj-87 -12 TD 1.57 Tw ("Arabs". As can be seen from his book "The Jewish State" \(Der )Tj294 0 TD 3.605 Tw (Judenstaat\) which was also)Tj-294 -12 TD 1.545 Tw (written \(or at least drafted\) in the summer of 1895, Herzl had not )Tj309 0 TD 3.003 Tw (yet decided on the final)Tj-309 -12 TD 1.913 Tw (location of the Jewish )Tj105 0 TD 3.566 Tw (State. "Shall we choose Palestine or Argentina?" wrote Herzl, and)Tj-105 -12 TD 0.201 Tc 0 Tw (listed the advantages of each of these two locations. \()Tj/F4 7 Tf245 3 TD (3)Tj/F4 10 Tf4 -3 TD 0.184 Tc (\) Although )Tj53 0 TD 0 Tc 2.07 Tw (Herzl did not state this in)Tj-302 -12 TD 0.