nicipal Library)TjT* 0.221 Tc (Kiryat Arba Religious School Library)TjT* -0.108 Tc (Labour Party, London)TjT* 0.275 Tc (Labour Party \(Mapai\) Archives, Bet Berl, Kfar Saba)TjT* 0.354 Tc (Lehi Archives, Tel-Aviv)TjT* 0.051 Tc (Library of Congress, Washington D.C.)TjT* 0.085 Tc (Liverpool Trades Council Archives)TjT* -0.03 Tc (Marks and Spencer Archives, London)TjT* 0.266 Tc (National Archives, Washington D.C.)TjT* 0.183 Tc (Nuffield College, Oxford)TjT* 0.101 Tc (Princeton University Library, New Jersey)TjT* -0.062 Tc (Public Record Office, London)TjT* 0.201 Tc (Sydney University Library)TjT* 0.295 Tc (Tel-Aviv University Library)TjT* 0.236 Tc (Temple, Cleveland, Ohio)TjT* 0.178 Tc (Weizmann Archives, Rehovot)TjT* 0.157 Tc (Zionist Archives, New York)Tj195 -24 TD 1.108 Tc (*******)Tj-169 -24 TD 0 Tc 3.912 Tw (Throughout this book )Tj111 0 TD 6.156 Tw (the term "Palestine" has been used for Eretz-Israel. No)Tj-137 -12 TD 0.154 Tc 0 Tw (ideological or political significance should be inferred from this.)Tj/F5 7 Tf178 -42 TD 0.25 Tc (\321    10    \321)TjET
