BT/F2 7 Tf181.5 781 TD 0.023 Tc 0 Tw (Chaim SIMONS : Proposals to Transfer Arabs from Palestine)Tj-10 -10 TD -0.18 Tc (\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321)Tj/F4 10 Tf-86 -25 TD 0.132 Tc (included, with brief biographies of prominent personalities.)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 0.991 Tw (The study is based almost entirely on primary sources, including )Tj299 0 TD 6.025 Tw (hitherto unpublished)Tj-325 -12 TD -0.15 Tc 0 Tw (documents obtained )Tj90 0 TD 0 Tc 2.82 Tw (from archives in Israel, the United States, Great Britain and Australia.)Tj-90 -12 TD 0.198 Tc 0 Tw (Diaries, memoirs, historical works, and newspaper files complement the archival material.)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 3.461 Tw (The issue of population transfer is a very delicate subject. )Tj290 0 TD 4.444 Tw (For this reason, many)Tj-316 -12 TD 0 Tw (proposers confined the exposition of )Tj163 0 TD 1.869 Tw (their ideas to diaries, private correspondence and closed)Tj-163 -12 TD 0 Tw (meetings. In )Tj56 0 TD 1.508 Tw (public they either ignored the subject of transfer or spoke against it. Even those)Tj-56 -12 TD 1.691 Tw (who did propose various schemes )Tj162 0 TD 3.212 Tw (were often reluctant to specifically suggest compulsory)Tj-162 -12 TD 0.223 Tc 0 Tw (transfer. They relied )Tj97 0 TD 0 Tc 1.092 Tw (on various euphemistic expressions to convey their intentions regarding)Tj-97 -12 TD -0.146 Tc 0 Tw (compulsion.)Tj26 -12 TD 0.233 Tc (I have therefore made it )Tj114 0 TD 0 Tc 2.011 Tw (an important aim of this work to ascertain the private views)Tj-140 -12 TD 1.488 Tw (of the proposers on )Tj94 0 TD 3.643 Tw (this subject. The wording of their proposals has also been carefully)Tj-94 -12 TD 1.803 Tw (analysed to determine whether the transfer of the Arabs from Palestine was intended )Tj402 0 TD 1.457 Tw (to be)Tj-402 -12 TD -0.06 Tc 0 Tw (compulsory or voluntary.)Tj26 -12 TD 0.077 Tc (One of the striking things to come to light during this research )Tj283 0 TD 0 Tc 2.463 Tw (is the attempt to rewrite)Tj-309 -12 TD 2.896 Tw (history and pretend that the Zionist leaders were completely opposed )Tj340 0 TD 3.926 Tw (to the transfer of)Tj-340 -12 TD -0.026 Tc 0 Tw (Arabs, even to the extent of censoring )Tj168 0 TD 0 Tc 0.732 Tw (portions of official minutes and amending of documents!)Tj-168 -12 TD 2.92 Tw (This rewriting is )Tj84 0 TD 4.173 Tw (reminiscent of the Russian Encyclopaedia. After Beria's execution, the)Tj-84 -12 TD 2.328 Tw (publishers of this encyclopaedia )Tj154 0 TD 1.762 Tw (wrote to its subscribers, suggesting they cut out the pages)Tj-154 -12 TD 2.345 Tw (dealing with "Beria" and in their place insert the enclosed )Tj279 0 TD 3.199 Tw (pages on the "Bering straits" -)Tj-279 -12 TD 0.254 Tc 0 Tw (which had the same alphabetical sequence! - \(BERIa, BERIng\).)Tj26 -12 TD 0.122 Tc (The reader of this book will notice )Tj158 0 TD 0 Tc 2.119 Tw (that its format is closer to that of an encyclopaedia)Tj-184 -12 TD 1.774 Tw (than a work set in an integrated historical framework. When I wrote )Tj325 0 TD 2.1 Tw (my first book on this)Tj-325 -12 TD 0.111 Tc 0 Tw (subject, I carefully weighed up these two alternative formats, and )Tj299 0 TD 0 Tc 1.371 Tw (came to the conclusion that)Tj-299 -12 TD 2.887 Tw (to keep the various transfer plans distinct, the encyclopaedic format )Tj331 0 TD 4.424 Tw (was preferable. My)Tj-331 -12 TD 0.949 Tw (continued research on this subject has in fact reinforced my )Tj274 0 TD 2.335 Tw (opinion on this point. However,)Tj-274 -12 TD 2.324 Tw (there are )Tj46 0 TD 2.263 Tw (in fact link ups between some of the proposals which were made and these are)Tj-46 -12 TD 0.096 Tc 0 Tw (pointed out in the text.)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 2.021 Tw (Finally, I will be more than happy to receive )Tj216 0 TD 0.961 Tw (comments, observations, corrections and)Tj-242 -12 TD 0 Tw (further information on this subject from my readers.)Tj26 -24 TD 0.112 Tc (Chaim Simons)Tj0 -12 TD 0.181 Tc (P.O.B. 1775)TjT* 0.39 Tc (Kiryat Arba)TjT* 0.457 Tc (Israel)TjT* 0.123 Tc (Tel: 02-9961252)Tj0 -24 TD 0 Tc (May 1998)Tj/F5 7 Tf154 -236 TD 0.227 Tc (\321    9    \321)TjET
