BT/F2 7 Tf181.5 781 TD 0.023 Tc 0 Tw (Chaim SIMONS : Proposals to Transfer Arabs from Palestine)Tj-10 -10 TD -0.18 Tc (\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321\321)Tj/F3 10 Tf73 -133 TD -0.282 Tc (I N T R O D U C T I O N)Tj/F4 10 Tf-133 -60 TD 0 Tc 2.64 Tw (What do Theodor Herzl, David Ben-Gurion and )Tj233 0 TD 4.63 Tw (Chaim Weizmann, all outstanding)Tj-259 -12 TD 0.258 Tc 0 Tw (Zionist leaders, have )Tj100 0 TD 0 Tc 1.6 Tw (in common with such diverse personalities as U.S. Presidents Franklin)Tj-100 -12 TD 0.117 Tc 0 Tw (D. Roosevelt )Tj60 0 TD 0 Tc 2.603 Tw (and Herbert Hoover and British anti-Zionist Harry St. John Philby. All these)Tj-60 -12 TD 2.004 Tw (statesmen - and )Tj78 0 TD 3.471 Tw (many others - have advanced proposals for the transfer of Arabs from)Tj-78 -12 TD 0.106 Tc 0 Tw (Palestine. These proposals are the subject of this book.)Tj26 -12 TD -0.083 Tc (One is sure to ask, how and when did I become )Tj208 0 TD 0 Tc 0.809 Tw (interested in such a subject? It was during)Tj-234 -12 TD 1.307 Tw (the 1970s when I was Director of Jewish )Tj189 0 TD 3.12 Tw (Studies at a Jewish High School in the North of)Tj-189 -12 TD 0.146 Tc 0 Tw (England. This was the period when Arab students at the various British Universities )Tj387 0 TD 0 Tc (began to)Tj-387 -12 TD 3.648 Tw (utilise the campuses to propagate )Tj169 0 TD 5.658 Tw (anti-Israel propaganda. The Jewish students at the)Tj-169 -12 TD 0.224 Tc 0 Tw (Universities were the first line )Tj143 0 TD 0 Tc 1.707 Tw (of Israel's defense, but at the time they had not been briefed)Tj-143 -12 TD 0.03 Tc 0 Tw (on how to answer the Arab students. I therefore brought out a booklet entitled "How to )Tj391 0 TD 0 Tc (Answer)Tj-391 -12 TD 0.034 Tc (Anti-Israel Propaganda" and this booklet was used with some success on the campuses.)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 2.091 Tw (Whilst researching this booklet, I came across )Tj218 0 TD 3.116 Tw (an anti-Zionist book which devoted a)Tj-244 -12 TD 1.43 Tw (couple of pages to show that there had been various proposals in the past to transfer )Tj398 0 TD 0 Tw (Arabs)Tj-398 -12 TD 1.111 Tw (from Palestine. I must )Tj104 0 TD 2.732 Tw (admit, that at the time, this came as quite a surprise to me, and I)Tj-104 -12 TD 0 Tw (decided )Tj38 0 TD 1.612 Tw (that when I had some time available I would look more deeply into the question. I)Tj-38 -12 TD 2.407 Tw (assumed that there were just a few stray statements on this subject and that )Tj369 0 TD 5.185 Tw (after I had)Tj-369 -12 TD 0.122 Tc 0 Tw (researched them, I would publish an article on the topic.)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 1.08 Tw (However, after I began research in 1984, I soon discovered )Tj271 0 TD 2.721 Tw (that it was not just "a few)Tj-297 -12 TD 0.16 Tc 0 Tw (stray statements" but that the transfer of Arabs from Palestine was definite )Tj344 0 TD 0 Tc 1.043 Tw (policy not only of)Tj-344 -12 TD 0.407 Tc 0 Tw (the )Tj18 0 TD 0 Tc 1.149 Tw (Zionist leaders, but also of many leading individual non-Jews \(including some who were)Tj-18 -12 TD 0.028 Tc 0 Tw (pro-Arab!\), non-Jewish organisations and even some Arabs.)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 1.089 Tw (The material I uncovered during my research was sufficient for a book )Tj327 0 TD 1.484 Tw (and in 1988 my)Tj-353 -12 TD 3.574 Tw (book "International Proposals to Transfer Arabs from Palestine, 1895-1947, A )Tj377 0 TD 0.46 Tc 0 Tw (Historical)Tj-377 -12 TD 0.165 Tc (Survey" was published.)Tj26 -12 TD 0.083 Tc (There is no end to research! I therefore )Tj176 0 TD 0 Tc 0.905 Tw (continued to research this subject and discovered)Tj-202 -12 TD 0.169 Tc 0 Tw (additional information. This was especially so in the case of )Tj276 0 TD 0 Tc 1.872 Tw (Edward Norman's transfer plan,)Tj-276 -12 TD 0.228 Tc 0 Tw (and therefore at the )Tj94 0 TD 0 Tc 0.893 Tw (beginning of 1991, I published an expanded version of this section of my)Tj-94 -12 TD 1.306 Tw (book under the )Tj74 0 TD 3.948 Tw (title "Edward Norman's Plan to Transfer Arabs from Palestine to Iraq.")Tj-74 -12 TD 1.716 Tw (Further research merited the bringing )Tj178 0 TD 1.825 Tw (out a supplement to my book \(of 1988\) and this was)Tj-178 -12 TD 0.047 Tc 0 Tw (published in January 1993.)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc (In May 1994, I combined and integrated )Tj178 0 TD 2.071 Tw (all the material appearing in my various books)Tj-204 -12 TD 0.2 Tc 0 Tw (on this subject, and together with the latest material which I had researched until )Tj377 0 TD 0 Tc 5.866 Tw (that time,)Tj-377 -12 TD 0.104 Tc 0 Tw (brought out a book which I called "HERZL TO EDEN".)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc (In September 1997 I brought out "Supplement Number 1" to "Herzl to Eden".)Tj0 -12 TD 1.574 Tw (I have now integrated )Tj106 0 TD 1.87 Tw (this supplement into my book which I am now putting on the)Tj-132 -12 TD 0.141 Tc 0 Tw (INTERNET. As I uncover new material, I add it at the appropriate place in the book.)Tj26 -12 TD 0 Tc 6.241 Tw (This study examines the transfer proposals put forward from )Tj329 0 TD 6.89 Tw (1895 to 1947.)Tj-355 -12 TD 0.132 Tc 0 Tw (Chronologically the earliest proposal appearing in my book )Tj274 0 TD 0 Tc 1.097 Tw (was made by Theodor Herzl and)Tj-274 -12 TD 1.93 Tw (the latest by Anthony Eden - hence the title "HERZL TO EDEN". )Tj310 0 TD 0 Tw (Contemporary arguments)Tj-310 -12 TD 1.311 Tw (both for and against the various plans are discussed, and )Tj267 0 TD 4.114 Tw (historical background material is)Tj/F5 7 Tf-87 -32 TD 0.227 Tc 0 Tw (\321    8    \321)TjET
endstreamendobj34 0 obj<</Length 868>>stream
